|}

Internal migration flows are strongly directional, with sustained movement from rural and non-metropolitan areas to the metropolitan centres, particularly [[Iskhal Megalopolis]], [[Lake Haro]], and [[Buran River Valley]]. The [[Greater Lanwaley Metropolitan Administration]] is the fastest-growing metropolitan area in the country.

